WEBVTT

00:01.430 --> 00:02.630
Fresh tidings, sire.

00:03.020 --> 00:08.190
The invaders are a coalition of 
anti-monarchist organizations, as suspected.

00:08.560 --> 00:12.210
They seek to seize control of the beast realm

00:12.210 --> 00:15.660
and call themselves the army of 
the "Wolf Without a Kingdom."

00:15.660 --> 00:17.510
"The Wolf Without a Kingdom"...

00:18.360 --> 00:21.120
So it <i>is</i> him.

00:21.440 --> 00:25.070
Find their leader Fenrir's 
stronghold with all haste.

00:25.500 --> 00:28.980
They may call themselves an army, 
but they are mere rabble.

00:28.980 --> 00:33.590
Strike down their head, and they will 
lose cohesion and disintegrate.

00:33.890 --> 00:34.620
Yes, sire!

00:35.720 --> 00:39.090
<i>Soon. I must find Sariphi soon.</i>

00:39.980 --> 00:43.810
Where is Lanteveldt? 
I've yet to receive his report.

00:44.640 --> 00:46.300
W-Well, sire...

00:49.510 --> 00:54.790
Hey, holy beast! Are we really 
getting closer to Sariphi?

00:54.790 --> 00:57.280
There's nothing but sand and rocks out here!

00:58.500 --> 01:01.060
Quit bellyaching, numbskull!

01:01.060 --> 01:05.460
I've lived a thousand years, greenhorn, 
so don't question the great Bennu!

01:05.460 --> 01:10.110
I don't know what you're saying, 
but I can tell it should piss me off!

01:09.710 --> 01:12.670
<b>Only Sariphi can understand
what Bennu says</b>

01:10.110 --> 01:11.530
What?! You want a piece of me?!

01:11.530 --> 01:12.660
S-Stop!

01:14.260 --> 01:15.590
Lante!

01:16.290 --> 01:18.150
Don't overdo it.

01:19.550 --> 01:23.330
Still, I can't sense that girlie anymore.

01:23.330 --> 01:27.160
They must've taken her 
someplace with a ward around it.

01:28.890 --> 01:33.170
I let them take her right in front of me.

01:33.170 --> 01:34.610
<i>She</i> protected <i>me</i>.

01:36.200 --> 01:40.210
I <i>will</i> get Sariphi back. I swear it!

03:10.960 --> 03:15.960
Pursuit and the Vassals' Battle

03:21.730 --> 03:22.890
What's wrong?

03:23.240 --> 03:25.520
It's not poisoned.

03:27.480 --> 03:31.990
I want a little more meat on 
your bones when I sacrifice you.

03:32.780 --> 03:35.320
Why do you want to be king?

03:36.500 --> 03:37.960
A foolish question.

03:38.300 --> 03:41.990
What man born needs a reason 
to strive for the top?

03:42.810 --> 03:45.230
I'm not like him.

03:45.230 --> 03:49.750
Not like that cowardly king who hates 
to fight despite his supremacy.

03:50.520 --> 03:52.210
You know His Majesty?

03:52.210 --> 03:57.480
A long time ago, I was the prince 
of an Ozmargan vassal state.

03:58.710 --> 04:03.470
But I was called a failure 
compared to my brothers.

04:03.710 --> 04:08.970
To my father, who hoped to overthrow 
our overlords, I was just in the way.

04:09.640 --> 04:13.970
Then, one day, I fought <i>him</i>.

04:14.910 --> 04:18.490
<i>This is my last chance to win Dad's approval.</i>

04:18.820 --> 04:23.740
<i>Unless I win this court duel, I'll be...</i>

04:28.870 --> 04:31.370
Blue flames? Well, now.

04:36.850 --> 04:39.490
H-He's overpowering me?!

04:45.980 --> 04:48.300
Wh-What power.

04:48.300 --> 04:52.220
How can he wield such magic at his age?

04:52.220 --> 04:54.270
So this is the blood of the king of beasts.

04:58.830 --> 04:59.980
<i>I lost.</i>

05:00.600 --> 05:03.840
<i>So easily, and so instantly.</i>

05:04.200 --> 05:06.980
<i>I couldn't even wound him!</i>

05:07.350 --> 05:08.490
Are you all right?

05:09.560 --> 05:12.070
Y-You want to show me mercy?

05:12.560 --> 05:14.230
Don't mock me!

05:14.230 --> 05:18.130
I swear I'll beat you someday!

05:18.960 --> 05:21.840
I don't like to fight.

05:23.040 --> 05:27.410
Next time we meet, let's play, not duel.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.260
As friends.

05:30.820 --> 05:32.410
<i>How dare you?!</i>

05:32.840 --> 05:35.470
<i>How dare you?! How dare you?!</i>

05:37.530 --> 05:42.430
Prince Fenrir will now 
be deprived of one ear,

05:42.430 --> 05:44.820
stripping him of his royal station.

05:44.820 --> 05:47.800
Father! Father, forgive me!

05:47.800 --> 05:50.290
I promise I'll win next time!

05:50.290 --> 05:51.660
Begin!

05:55.020 --> 06:00.430
Then I lost my ear, and with it, 
everything. They cast me out.

06:01.090 --> 06:03.580
And that's why you hold a 
grudge against His Majesty?

06:03.580 --> 06:04.660
A grudge?

06:05.070 --> 06:09.470
No. We fought fair and square.

06:09.470 --> 06:13.390
Back then, he was strong, and I was weak.

06:13.720 --> 06:16.140
So next time, I'll beat him.

06:16.140 --> 06:18.640
Then I'll take back my stolen pride

06:18.640 --> 06:23.600
and rule supreme through fear, 
as a truly mighty king!

06:24.500 --> 06:27.490
A mighty king?

06:27.950 --> 06:31.670
Yes! I'll return this realm to a blank slate!

06:31.670 --> 06:35.890
Beasts will fight each other as in days of old,

06:35.890 --> 06:38.070
and I'll stand above them all!

06:38.960 --> 06:42.660
What about those who are 
weak or don't want to fight?

06:42.660 --> 06:47.220
They'll be culled, of course. 
That's the law of nature.

06:47.490 --> 06:50.300
That's the world I strive for.

06:50.300 --> 06:53.290
If the weak want to survive there,

06:53.290 --> 06:57.710
they must bow to the strong, 
abandoning pride and quaking with fear.

06:58.440 --> 07:01.180
And humans will be no exception.

07:01.180 --> 07:03.400
I'll abolish the border with Yoana

07:03.400 --> 07:07.440
and make a world where beasts 
can feast on humans as they please.

07:07.440 --> 07:09.450
Doesn't that scare you?

07:09.450 --> 07:13.770
Your heart must be shaking like a leaf!

07:14.660 --> 07:15.620
Why?

07:17.580 --> 07:20.750
Why should I be afraid of you?

07:21.270 --> 07:22.970
Because you're strong?

07:23.500 --> 07:26.160
If that's it, then you don't scare me at all.

07:26.650 --> 07:32.560
I know someone who always battles 
his own weakness for other people.

07:33.040 --> 07:35.560
Someone who has <i>real</i> strength.

07:36.750 --> 07:39.380
So I'm not afraid of you.

07:40.040 --> 07:44.170
If you can only feel strong by hurting people,

07:44.170 --> 07:47.440
that's because you're weak.

07:47.850 --> 07:50.220
You could never beat His Majesty.

08:01.420 --> 08:04.680
<i>Was that... his magic?</i>

08:05.150 --> 08:09.580
<i>Did he imbue that ring with 
power to protect this woman?</i>

08:10.100 --> 08:14.780
<i>Does he really care for her that deeply?</i>

08:15.860 --> 08:17.650
Intriguing.

08:18.020 --> 08:21.910
Now I really do want her.

08:22.480 --> 08:25.350
<b></b>Ozmargo's far eastern border,
near Kotan

08:25.710 --> 08:28.090
The Ozmargan troops are retreating.

08:28.090 --> 08:29.850
Don't let them escape! After them!

08:32.250 --> 08:33.350
Wh-What?!

08:33.350 --> 08:35.830
Oh, no! This is an antlion pit!

08:36.130 --> 08:39.150
So you neglected even basic reconnaissance.

08:39.150 --> 08:42.120
No one familiar with the lay 
of the land would go there.

08:43.050 --> 08:46.640
Dirty tricks! Have you no beastly pride?!

08:46.950 --> 08:51.590
Fools who would harm my king have 
no business lecturing <i>me</i> about pride.

08:52.420 --> 08:53.560
Sink.

08:55.760 --> 09:02.350
<b></b>In the city of Kotan

08:56.930 --> 08:59.270
The diversionary operation 
succeeded, too, sir!

08:59.270 --> 09:02.340
And we've nearly mopped up 
the remnants in the city.

09:02.590 --> 09:07.420
As you ordered, sir, we've also 
begun pursuing those who fled.

09:07.420 --> 09:11.210
Good. They'll likely try 
to join their comrades.

09:11.210 --> 09:13.950
Alert the palace as soon as you locate them.

09:13.950 --> 09:17.360
In the meantime, make camp 
here and remain alert.

09:17.360 --> 09:18.000
Yes, sir!

09:20.970 --> 09:22.150
Who goes there?!

09:23.400 --> 09:27.080
<i>It's him! Fenrir's right-hand 
man from the reports!</i>

09:27.080 --> 09:32.460
You must be the tactician who played 
so many crafty tricks on us.

09:32.460 --> 09:35.540
Still, you may make a worthy pawn.

09:36.760 --> 09:39.930
Tell me, would you join us?

09:39.930 --> 09:41.030
What?

09:41.030 --> 09:48.490
We're kin, aren't we? Go back far enough, 
and our peoples share ancestors.

09:48.900 --> 09:54.950
So you should serve a wolf king, 
not one from the royal line of beasts.

09:55.180 --> 10:00.770
You mock me. I <i>chose</i> the king I serve.

10:00.770 --> 10:03.420
What do our species matter next to that?

10:06.100 --> 10:08.580
I see. In that case,

10:10.580 --> 10:12.250
you'll have to die.

10:16.550 --> 10:17.390
No, thank you.

10:18.920 --> 10:19.760
No, thank you.

10:21.300 --> 10:22.140
No, thank you.

10:22.140 --> 10:25.230
What? What more do you want?

10:26.190 --> 10:30.090
What does that man do to win you over?

10:30.090 --> 10:32.640
How did he get you in the mood?

10:33.380 --> 10:36.270
His Majesty always gives me lots of things,

10:36.750 --> 10:38.330
like words and feelings.

10:39.000 --> 10:42.190
But they make me happy 
because they come from him.

10:43.080 --> 10:45.100
They wouldn't mean anything 
coming from someone else.

10:46.050 --> 10:48.740
I don't want anything from you.

10:49.000 --> 10:52.770
Ha! You sure are a prickly one.

10:52.770 --> 10:55.710
You ought to learn from Nir.

10:55.710 --> 10:56.690
Nir?

10:57.840 --> 11:01.600
That man you were with? Is he nice, then?

11:01.600 --> 11:02.420
Yes.

11:02.830 --> 11:06.080
I picked him up on a whim 
when I was just a pup.

11:06.080 --> 11:09.490
He felt so grateful that it 
sent his destiny off-course.

11:09.490 --> 11:12.270
Now he's my stupid, lovable slave.

11:12.780 --> 11:17.980
You fool! How dare you lay hands 
on gifts meant for royalty?!

11:17.980 --> 11:19.410
I'm sorry!

11:19.410 --> 11:22.690
I was so hungry I couldn't help it!

11:22.690 --> 11:26.760
I bought you when no one else would, 
and this is how you repay me?!

11:27.710 --> 11:30.640
If you don't need that slave, give him here.

11:32.420 --> 11:33.820
Your Highness?!

11:35.730 --> 11:38.060
There. That's better!

11:38.060 --> 11:39.350
Um...

11:39.350 --> 11:42.720
Now I'm finally living like royalty!

11:42.720 --> 11:47.450
I've never had my own servant, 
even though all my big brothers do.

11:47.450 --> 11:50.060
But from now on, I've got you!

11:51.270 --> 11:54.080
Hey, what's your name?

11:54.080 --> 11:56.260
Th-Thirty-six Two.

11:56.510 --> 11:59.490
Thirty? That's a weird name.

11:59.800 --> 12:03.540
It's not a name, just what they 
called me at the slave market.

12:04.060 --> 12:05.560
I don't have a name.

12:06.240 --> 12:10.410
Really? I guess I'll have to give you one, then.

12:10.410 --> 12:12.540
A name? For me?

12:12.540 --> 12:14.510
That's right. Don't you need one?

12:14.510 --> 12:16.720
It ought to sound cool.

12:16.720 --> 12:19.080
But not cooler than mine, got that?

12:20.090 --> 12:23.540
I've got it! Your name's Gleipnir!

12:24.290 --> 12:26.050
Gleip...?

12:26.370 --> 12:30.410
Gleipnir. Nir for short.

12:30.840 --> 12:36.270
It's the name of a special cord used 
to bind the ancestor of all wolves.

12:36.270 --> 12:38.740
Really?! It's that important?!

12:39.070 --> 12:42.170
This cord will tie us together forever.

12:42.170 --> 12:45.910
Always stay by me. Come running 
to my side from wherever you are.

12:46.320 --> 12:48.610
<i>And be quick about it, you hear?!</i>

12:51.570 --> 12:53.670
I'm not fond of pointless killing.

12:54.210 --> 12:57.880
Well? If you want to reconsider, 
this is your last chance.

12:57.880 --> 12:59.080
No,

12:59.080 --> 13:04.420
this is <i>your</i> last chance 
to stop your king's folly.

13:04.420 --> 13:11.430
Guide your sovereign down the proper path, 
even if that means defying him.

13:11.430 --> 13:15.280
That is a vassal's duty.

13:15.280 --> 13:19.850
I give everything for my king! 
I need no pride!

13:20.320 --> 13:25.520
I'm not Fenrir's vassal. I belong to him.

13:25.520 --> 13:29.060
If he wants to be king, 
I'll put him on the throne.

13:29.060 --> 13:30.690
But that's all.

13:31.420 --> 13:33.700
No more, and no less.

13:35.000 --> 13:36.850
<i>So this is the end.</i>

13:36.850 --> 13:44.920
<i>His Majesty has others to support him 
when I'm gone, so I leave no regrets.</i>

13:45.830 --> 13:49.690
<i>No matter who the person closest to him is.</i>

13:54.030 --> 13:57.120
It's too soon to say your prayers, Abi.

13:58.110 --> 13:59.180
Who are you?!

13:59.580 --> 14:04.660
Jormungand, captain of the 
Royal Guard of Ozmargo!

14:07.170 --> 14:09.540
<i>He wields two blades remotely.</i>

14:09.990 --> 14:12.750
<i>And he aims precisely for my blind spots.</i>

14:14.700 --> 14:15.610
<i>In which case...</i>

14:15.950 --> 14:18.160
So, you covered one blind spot.

14:18.160 --> 14:21.810
But you can't attack me like that.

14:22.140 --> 14:25.160
Jor, what are you doing here?!

14:25.160 --> 14:29.470
I told you to... defend His Majesty!

14:29.850 --> 14:32.350
And His Majesty ordered me here, Abi.

14:33.000 --> 14:36.850
He told me to protect you, his friend.

14:38.670 --> 14:39.680
There!

14:40.660 --> 14:42.410
He left himself open on purpose?!

14:58.820 --> 15:03.450
So... your blade reached me... first.

15:03.970 --> 15:05.910
Only by a hair's breadth.

15:06.760 --> 15:13.010
If you still had your left eye, 
the reverse may have happened.

15:16.170 --> 15:17.190
You mean to flee?!

15:17.530 --> 15:21.450
You said yourself that you need no pride.

15:21.880 --> 15:27.500
Neither do I. I gave all of mine to him.

15:28.400 --> 15:33.870
This scar is proof of it. 
I feel neither shame nor regret.

15:34.360 --> 15:39.580
We'll settle this another time. 
I can't afford to die yet.

15:39.580 --> 15:40.800
Wait!

15:41.340 --> 15:42.080
Abi!

15:42.550 --> 15:46.290
I'll follow him. No doubt 
he'll return to his master.

15:46.290 --> 15:48.330
But with your wounds—

15:48.330 --> 15:51.010
You expect me to leave myself in your debt?

15:51.440 --> 15:54.760
I will be the one to locate Fenrir's lair!

15:56.000 --> 15:57.380
You can be so stubborn.

15:57.380 --> 15:58.350
What?!

15:59.040 --> 16:01.090
I'll take the reins.

16:02.570 --> 16:05.800
Let's go meet our king's enemy.

16:09.200 --> 16:11.350
Make sure you keep your eye closed.

16:11.350 --> 16:16.310
We won't be able to talk to Blob No. 2 
anymore if anything happens to it.

16:16.310 --> 16:17.790
It's closed!

16:18.390 --> 16:23.010
Still, I bet <i>we're</i> gonna need 
rescuing before we find Sariphi.

16:23.470 --> 16:25.660
But we can't turn back without...

16:27.520 --> 16:28.500
What's that?

16:30.590 --> 16:31.880
A report, sire!

16:32.360 --> 16:38.140
The Istanese navy has captured supporters 
of the wolf on the Loake Sea!

16:39.020 --> 16:44.980
And Chancellor Anubis sends word that 
he has driven the wolf's forces from Kotan!

16:45.420 --> 16:48.110
Have you tracked down their leader Fenrir?

16:49.590 --> 16:51.700
As to that... the search 
proceeds with all haste!

16:51.700 --> 16:52.890
By Your Majesty's leave!

16:56.290 --> 17:00.360
S-Sire! I promise Sari will come back!

17:00.360 --> 17:03.530
S-Soon! And unhurt!

17:03.860 --> 17:05.350
S-So...

17:06.220 --> 17:08.370
<i>Is he trying to lift my spirits?</i>

17:09.190 --> 17:14.870
<i>Not long ago, merely being in my 
presence made his faint heart quail.</i>

17:24.930 --> 17:30.640
<i>We are all changing, slowly but surely.</i>

17:31.800 --> 17:35.110
<i>Sariphi, you have changed us all.</i>

17:35.950 --> 17:40.200
<i>I want you back soon. Soon.</i>

17:41.250 --> 17:42.810
<i>I want to touch you.</i>

17:46.370 --> 17:47.310
Leo?

17:55.520 --> 17:58.530
What is that look in your eyes? Pity?

17:59.400 --> 18:01.860
That... could be.

18:02.680 --> 18:05.380
You remind me just a little of myself.

18:06.450 --> 18:09.280
Your family cast you out without warning.

18:09.280 --> 18:11.890
You lost your home and who you were.

18:12.670 --> 18:17.880
If nothing else, I know just 
how terrifying that is.

18:21.680 --> 18:24.080
But I hate the way you think.

18:26.710 --> 18:27.620
You don't say.

18:30.460 --> 18:35.750
It looks like a mouse—make that 
two mice—have tripped my wards.

18:35.750 --> 18:36.530
What?

18:36.530 --> 18:38.520
I recognize this scent.

18:38.520 --> 18:40.550
They might have followed you here.

18:40.550 --> 18:43.000
N-No! Who would have...

18:44.010 --> 18:46.730
All right. Let's have some fun.

18:46.730 --> 18:48.290
W-Wait!

18:49.600 --> 18:51.430
Sariphi is here.

18:55.340 --> 18:56.640
What's this?

18:56.640 --> 18:59.570
I went looking for a mouse and found a cat.

18:59.570 --> 19:02.650
Try to keep me entertained.

19:02.650 --> 19:05.690
I figured I'd find your sorry ass here!

19:08.320 --> 19:10.270
I can't get free!

19:09.630 --> 19:10.660
Sari!

19:11.570 --> 19:12.800
Sari!

19:13.250 --> 19:15.120
Cy?! Bennu?!

19:15.490 --> 19:16.900
How did you get here?!

19:16.900 --> 19:18.500
No time to explain!

19:19.090 --> 19:20.050
Take that!

19:20.410 --> 19:21.690
Hop on, girlie.

19:21.690 --> 19:23.560
Oh, thank you!

19:25.880 --> 19:29.520
You know, Fenrir noticed you coming.

19:29.520 --> 19:31.240
I'm amazed you didn't get caught.

19:31.240 --> 19:33.950
Nah, he has no clue I'm here.

19:33.950 --> 19:36.060
I've got no smell.

19:36.060 --> 19:37.510
Huh? But...

19:38.660 --> 19:39.760
Don't tell me...

19:39.760 --> 19:42.310
Sounds like the plan's working.

19:43.310 --> 19:48.280
We're supposed to find you and get out 
while the decoy keeps him busy.

19:48.650 --> 19:50.500
Please, Bennu, turn back!

19:50.760 --> 19:51.450
Sari...

19:52.050 --> 19:57.620
Are you sure? He might not thank 
you for screwing up his sacrifice.

19:57.990 --> 19:59.640
I still have to save him.

19:59.640 --> 20:01.500
Lante could die!

20:02.230 --> 20:07.400
If you can't put up more of a fight, 
you're not even good for killing time.

20:08.930 --> 20:14.140
Of course, this would be a little more 
fun if you tried running for your life.

20:14.690 --> 20:16.770
Like hell I'd run!

20:16.770 --> 20:19.650
I'm the captain of Sariphi's guard!

20:19.650 --> 20:22.620
I came here ready to die!

20:23.960 --> 20:27.620
Don't brag about selling 
your life cheap, whelp.

20:28.000 --> 20:33.120
If you don't know the right time for 
self-sacrifice, you can die right now!

20:35.140 --> 20:35.920
Lante!

20:38.170 --> 20:40.620
Let go! I'll stall him while—

20:40.620 --> 20:43.820
No! I won't let you die as a decoy!

20:44.890 --> 20:47.080
I'm the captain of your Queen's Guard!

20:47.600 --> 20:49.800
Risking my life is what I'm here for!

20:50.110 --> 20:52.410
I'd die to protect you!

20:52.410 --> 20:54.260
If you won't let me do that,

20:54.260 --> 20:57.700
why'd you make me captain in the first place?!

20:59.110 --> 21:02.370
To make you a real Queen's Guard captain!

21:03.790 --> 21:07.660
Guards aren't there to die for their masters!

21:07.660 --> 21:12.280
I want you to witness the day 
I become a genuine queen!

21:14.220 --> 21:16.140
I can see outside, girlie!

21:16.140 --> 21:19.130
Hang on tight while I crash through the ward!

21:21.170 --> 21:25.160
I'll be your witness. 
I'll see you be a great queen!

21:26.420 --> 21:27.630
Here goes nothing!

21:36.650 --> 21:38.460
Lante! Bennu!

21:40.310 --> 21:44.140
Thank you both so much! 
I'll take it from here!

21:44.740 --> 21:48.910
To think she even commands a holy beast.

21:49.340 --> 21:53.130
All right, then. Time for a game of tag.

21:54.250 --> 21:56.830
Sire! I got a message from Cy!

21:57.330 --> 22:02.740
Past the stony desert southwest of Goya's 
capital, in the heart of Sabarro Valley,

22:02.740 --> 22:05.800
they've found the enemy leader 
Fenrir's hidden stronghold!

22:07.080 --> 22:08.900
And Sariphi is there with him!

23:25.950 --> 23:28.600
